0 25 737 [
[(The more "natural" units for describing a formant might be center frequency and)]
[(bandwidth, so that you can change the fundamental without having the formant)]
[(shift up and down in parallel. Here all three frequencies are expressed in MIDI)]
[(units. The bandwidth and center frequency have to be divided by the fundamental)]
[(\050the expr 1/$f1 takes its reciprocal and two [*~] objects finish the division.\051)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
